		{
			dependencies: [
				"7EEECACB3CF28AE2"
				"01102ABB3B3F4EF1"
			]
			description: [
				"These are cable-attached components that handle container interaction with your network! Each is pretty self-explanatory. On each, you can right click with an empty hand to set up filters, and the filter slots can be expanded with upgrades."
				""
				"Flip to the next page to read more about each!"
				""
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Importer - Imports items into your storage system from the inventory it is attached to."
				""
				"Exporter - Exports items (set by it's filter) to the inventory it's attached to."
				""
				"External Storage - Uses the inventory it's connected to as a place to store items. Allows your storage system to interact with it as it would storage discs."
				""
				"Destructor - Breaks blocks in the world and imports the drops into your storage system."
				""
				"Constructor - Places blocks in the world from your storage system."
			]
			id: "6D52CC43A0EF083E"
			rewards: [
				{
